---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">About Europe in Space</h1>
  <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Europe in Space is an independent project exploring European space missions and science through interactive visualizations and public data.</p>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-slate-300">The first milestone will connect a curated mission to a prediction of a spacecraft’s orbit. Predictions will not be live telemetry and must not be used for operational or safety-critical purposes.</p>
</BaseLayout>
